      "content": "2.5.1 Forest Cover"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7wrdlro",
      "content": "Punjab has very limited forest cover :approximately 6.1% of its total area (as per Forest Survey of India). This is well below the national average of 21.7%. The state is predominantly agricultural."
    },
